{"id":"661869","name":"山药胡萝卜炖丝瓜","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/661869/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山药","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净去皮切块。","img":"images/661869/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"丝瓜洗净去皮切滚刀块。","img":"images/661869/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"山药洗净去皮切滚刀块。","img":"images/661869/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放入食用油，料酒、盐、先放入胡萝卜及山药块炖煮。","img":"images/661869/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"八成熟再加入丝瓜。","img":"images/661869/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炖煮5分钟即可，加入适量的鸡精。","img":"images/661869/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盛入碗中，三色蔬菜不仅颜色美观，而且营养鲜美。","img":"images/661869/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}